original_text:
Now I have enough material
for my novel. Thank you, 
⟦FF21⟧!⟦PAUSE⟧

I'll just have to get better
for your sake then, 
won’t I? Hee hee.⟦PAUSE⟧

Really? A birthday present
for me? ⟦PAUSE⟧⟦PAGE⟧If I told my mom about this,
she’s be so surprised!⟦PAUSE⟧

It's cute, but please don't
let animals in the house,
budum.⟦PAUSE⟧

Well, 
if you're already busy,
I understand...I guess...⟦PAUSE⟧
